        "lastValidSource": "// Shared behavior owns collision and task counters.\n@export(type=\"int\") let collision_count = 0;\n@export(type=\"int\") let task_count = 0;\nfn family_awake() { task_wait(\"family_ready\", 0.2); }\nfn family_collision(other, px, py, nx, ny, rvx, rvy) { collision_count += 1; log_info(\"FAMILY_COLLISION\"); }\nfn family_task(name) { task_count += 1; log_info(\"FAMILY_TASK\"); }\nfn family_destroy() { log_debug(\"FAMILY_DESTROY\"); }\n",
